-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-06: approved

  Replay      3 RZX recordings, 24700 frames, 105855 paired hook calls. CPU
              registers including R, working RAM and original sound I/O match.
              Independent original-plotter pixel oracle passes the same
              recordings.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104. Boot and NEXLOAD printer-buffer restoration pass;
              native same-update bitmap and palette checks pass. Real-loader
              result is recorded separately.

  Coverage    Menus, controls, forest and cave play, shooting, jumping, spirit
              use, death, game over and attract scenes. One-life death fixture
              is labelled. 7 of 8 hook sites reached by recordings; all 8
              tested at four incoming speeds. 298 figure/edge tests cover all
              50 large IDs and 14 small IDs. Full natural completion of all
              levels is not claimed.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
